OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny heavy,
OL,6,Fthundery showers, clearing eastwards
OL,7,Fthis evening then clear spells and
OL,8,Flargely dry overnight. A few mist and
OL,9,Ffog patches forming by dawn with rain
OL,10,Farriving into the far west by dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA bright start in the east,
OL,13,Fbut soon turning cloudy from the west
OL,14,Fwith outbreaks of rain reaching the
OL,15,Fregion from early morning, these
OL,16,Flocally heavy and perhaps thundery.
OL,17,FMild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
